    "Summaries": {
        "eng": "Momoko is a beautiful young sword fighter who was born inside a peach (momo in Japanese). She lives with her constant companions—the dog god Inugami, the monkey god Sarugami, and the pheasant god Kijigami—in a peaceful paradise. However, a demon army led by devil king invades the paradise and steals the precious treasure that protects Momoko's land. To retrieve the treasure and save the people, Momoko embarks on a great adventure with her three companions.",
        "jpn": "ヒロインの『桃子』は、桃から生まれた天然系美少女。\r\n「皇天女」から一つになると世界を変えられるほどのパワーを持つ\r\n三千実の桃（みちみのもも）のカケラを探し集めて欲しいとの願いを受け、\r\n持ち前の正義感から犬神、猿神、雉神のお供を連れ、旅へ出ることに。"
    },
